01:26:16,000 --> 01:26:17,640
I could go free-climb
with my bare hands.

2493
01:26:17,640 --> 01:26:19,640
Seriously, I feel like my joints
are so strong.

2494
01:26:19,640 --> 01:26:21,040
But there have to be two big guys below

2495
01:26:21,040 --> 01:26:21,800
holding your legs up

2496
01:26:22,280 --> 01:26:23,040
and you lean back.

2497
01:26:24,880 --> 01:26:26,600
What's all this dropped on the floor?

2498
01:26:27,640 --> 01:26:28,760
Was it your wisdom?

2499
01:26:28,760 --> 01:26:29,520
I'm going limp!

2500
01:26:30,200 --> 01:26:31,160
Have to go around.

2501
01:26:31,160 --> 01:26:32,400
We're like on a farm,

2502
01:26:32,400 --> 01:26:33,600
moving a scarecrow.

2503
01:26:33,600 --> 01:26:34,600
Ready, one two three!

2504
01:26:34,600 --> 01:26:35,240
Legs over there.

2505
01:26:35,240 --> 01:26:36,120
Wang Churan,

2506
01:26:36,120 --> 01:26:37,120
if you don't have the diamond drill,

2507
01:26:37,120 --> 01:26:38,720
don't take on this china-mending job.

2508
01:26:39,720 --> 01:26:40,560
Don't let next month

2509
01:26:40,560 --> 01:26:41,560
show Wang Churan

2510
01:26:41,560 --> 01:26:42,600
going viral for weightlifting.

2511
01:26:42,600 --> 01:26:44,480
Churan's muscles ballooned a whole size

2512
01:26:44,480 --> 01:26:45,000
suddenly.

2513
01:26:45,000 --> 01:26:46,040
I was speechless.

2514
01:26:46,900 --> 01:26:48,700
Vibey Chat telephone.

2515
01:26:48,860 --> 01:26:50,140
(Sweet)

2516
01:26:51,040 --> 01:26:52,240
Heavenly King covers the earth tiger!

2517
01:26:52,240 --> 01:26:53,520
Teng, 75kg.

2518
01:26:53,520 --> 01:26:55,160
Hope we can pull this off
by working together.

2519
01:26:58,240 --> 01:26:59,960
His face went bright red.

2520
01:27:00,740 --> 01:27:01,580
(Screaming-and-running-away.gif)

2521
01:27:02,040 --> 01:27:03,680
Look at my back muscles.

2522
01:27:04,320 --> 01:27:05,960
Look at my back muscles.

2523
01:27:07,080 --> 01:27:08,000
How's the training going?

2524
01:27:09,080 --> 01:27:09,760
Awesome.

2525
01:27:09,760 --> 01:27:11,400
I think the old guy who swaps the water jugs
trains better than you,

2526
01:27:11,400 --> 01:27:12,600
and you're still here posing.

2527
01:27:14,240 --> 01:27:15,120
Let me give you

2528
01:27:15,120 --> 01:27:15,960
a good jolt.

2529
01:27:17,080 --> 01:27:17,760
Come on, stand up.

2530
01:27:17,760 --> 01:27:18,080
Come on.

2531
01:27:18,680 --> 01:27:19,800
Come on, train with your master.

2532
01:27:21,200 --> 01:27:21,920
Look at my back.

2533
01:27:22,360 --> 01:27:22,880
Come on.

2534
01:27:23,320 --> 01:27:23,960
Master's taking it off.

2535
01:27:24,480 --> 01:27:24,920
Off!

2536
01:27:29,240 --> 01:27:30,600
Everyone's gone all "woo-woo".

2537
01:27:31,200 --> 01:27:33,800
I definitely got it across, I think.

2538
01:27:33,800 --> 01:27:34,520
Pick "weird".

2539
01:27:35,220 --> 01:27:36,140
Crazy!

2540
01:27:38,580 --> 01:27:39,580
Little painter.

2541
01:27:39,580 --> 01:27:42,680
(Bonus episode preview)

2542
01:27:42,680 --> 01:27:43,880
What even is all this?

2543
01:27:45,060 --> 01:27:46,180
(Showing you one more)

2544
01:27:47,340 --> 01:27:48,460
(Showing the drawings)

2545
01:27:48,460 --> 01:27:50,200
(Bai Jingting's work)
Wait, what's the one on the far left?

2546
01:27:50,840 --> 01:27:51,680
Is that a cow?

2547
01:27:51,680 --> 01:27:52,760
Looks like a pig.

2548
01:27:53,000 --> 01:27:54,360
But what I drew is this one.

2549
01:27:54,360 --> 01:27:55,360
(Claiming it automatically)
You drew me in.

2550
01:27:55,360 --> 01:27:55,760
Yeah.

2551
01:27:55,760 --> 01:27:56,651
(Instant Venus)
A photo of Chengcheng

2552
01:27:56,651 --> 01:27:57,840
(Instant Venus)
from when he entered Mr. Olympia.

2553
01:27:59,360 --> 01:28:00,520
I didn't draw this turtle.

2554
01:28:00,520 --> 01:28:01,200
Turtle?

2555
01:28:01,720 --> 01:28:03,600
(Clearing his name)
It's a ceiling light, a light.

2556
01:28:03,600 --> 01:28:05,240
Who takes gym photos

2557
01:28:05,240 --> 01:28:07,080
without standing
under the overhead light?

2558
01:28:07,140 --> 01:28:08,380
(Slowly getting it)

2559
01:28:08,600 --> 01:28:09,400
Overhead light.

2560
01:28:09,880 --> 01:28:11,040
I drew this one and this one.

2561
01:28:11,220 --> 01:28:12,100
(Serious)
"Undercover".

2562
01:28:12,960 --> 01:28:14,680
Churan, just say it outright.

2563
01:28:14,680 --> 01:28:16,280
That's a cow and a guy.

2564
01:28:16,280 --> 01:28:17,880
(Guy, cow)
You drew a "cow guy", right?

2565
01:28:17,880 --> 01:28:20,040
I think Bai is actually pretty suspicious.

2566
01:28:20,040 --> 01:28:21,680
A matador beauty pageant.

2567
01:28:21,680 --> 01:28:23,320
I think it's a drawing of a toilet.

2568
01:28:23,480 --> 01:28:25,480
(So anxious he almost flew off)
I drew a man!

2569
01:28:25,480 --> 01:28:26,680
The whole thing is Bing.

2570
01:28:26,680 --> 01:28:27,360
(Who is this?)
What's this?

2571
01:28:27,420 --> 01:28:28,200
(Is this me?)

2572
01:28:28,200 --> 01:28:29,200
Then we can only go with Bai.

2573
01:28:29,200 --> 01:28:30,400
(I'm set on Hu)
There's also a lollipop we could vote out.

2574
01:28:30,400 --> 01:28:30,920
If you vote me out,

2575
01:28:30,920 --> 01:28:32,200
(Threatening)
I'll take your big mountain bike

2576
01:28:32,200 --> 01:28:32,880
and throw it out.

2577
01:28:32,880 --> 01:28:33,640
I'm voting him out.

2578
01:28:33,640 --> 01:28:34,260
Please vote.

2579
01:28:34,260 --> 01:28:36,380
(So who's the undercover?)

2580
01:28:36,380 --> 01:28:57,620
(Natural High S4 Viewing Calendar)
